### TLS keystore (springchat3_deployment.md, project memory) ###
# The build embeds a build-time-generated keystore.p12 under
# build/generated-resources (already covered by build/ above). This is a
# safety net against ever tracking a *manually* dropped-in copy of the
# real cert/key material anywhere under src/ - e.g. src/main/resources/tls/,
# which happened once (2026-08-21) and was cleaned up.
**/tls/keystore.p12
*.p12
_to_delete/
.env
